<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλικός</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to matter, material,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλικὴ οὐσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1044a15
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1049a36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.144
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἀρχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					640b5
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1035a8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.6.5
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.5.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντελεχείᾳ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1078a31
			</span></i>:—cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλικόν</span></b> , τό, perh. <i>woodwork,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰν ἐπισκενὰν τῶν τάφων κ[αὶ
					τοῦ] ὑλικοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Annuario</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			/<i><span class="en">
				9.322
			</span></i> (Rhodes, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>).</div>
